g=\"ja\">演技</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">演技；表演</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">技師</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">工程师；技术员</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">低</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>低；降低；贬低</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひく.い・ひく.める・ひく.まる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">低い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひくい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">低；等级低；程度低；价值低；内容低；质量低；低位；贴近地面；矮；身材矮；（声音）低沉；音调低；音量小</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">最低</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいてい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">最少；最低；最小；最坏；最差；糟糕；可怕；恶劣；令人厌恶；至少；最起码</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">低下</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ていか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">下降；衰退；降低；恶化；退化</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">復</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>恢复；返回；重做；复原</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">フク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">また</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">復習</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふくしゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">复习；温习</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">回復</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいふく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">恢复；复原；康复；回复；改善；（病后）恢复；痊愈；康复</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">往復</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おうふく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">往返；来回；往返